WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.791
[knocking on door]

00:00:02.708 --> 00:00:04.708
[emotional music continues]

00:00:17.666 --> 00:00:18.541
[Barb] Who is it?

00:00:25.541 --> 00:00:27.125
It's the Mormons.

00:00:27.208 --> 00:00:30.166
[Bob] For the last time,
we're not converting!

00:00:32.875 --> 00:00:34.500
["Curls" by Bibio playing]

00:00:56.791 --> 00:01:01.500
♪ To see within
Is to feel without a light ♪

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:07.250
♪ Who'd have thought
That we'd break the things we like? ♪

00:01:08.708 --> 00:01:13.000
♪ To find a stone
Just to bounce across the pond ♪

00:01:14.083 --> 00:01:18.875
♪ Is the path it makes
That's a clue to other songs ♪

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:24.625
♪ Her hair, it curls
In the depth of the night ♪

00:01:25.833 --> 00:01:30.500
♪ The scent recalls
Like a photograph with life ♪

00:01:31.583 --> 00:01:36.333
♪ Her hair, it curls
In the depth of the night ♪

00:01:37.416 --> 00:01:42.125
♪ The scent recalls
Like a photograph with life ♪

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:59.750
♪ To live without
Is to live under a spell ♪

00:02:01.458 --> 00:02:05.375
♪ Who'd have thought
That we'd turn our home to hell? ♪

00:02:06.708 --> 00:02:11.625
♪ To find a bone
And to float it down the stream ♪

00:02:11.708 --> 00:02:13.500
So, what do we do now?

00:02:15.708 --> 00:02:18.208
-Kiss her, you idiot!
-[Josh laughs]

00:02:18.291 --> 00:02:22.833
♪ Her hair curls
In the damp of the night ♪

00:02:24.166 --> 00:02:28.791
♪ The scent recalls
Like a photograph with life ♪

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:34.583
♪ Her woolen coat
Under yellow sodium lights ♪

00:02:35.875 --> 00:02:40.458
♪ Records the air like a memory of night&nbsp;♪

